          "settings": {
            "content": "<h5>Academic and learning evaluations are designed to provide diagnostic clarity when there are questions about reading, writing, math, memory, processing speed, attention, executive functioning, language, or school performance.</h5><h5>At Center for Balanced Living, learning evaluations are completed with care and attention to the whole student. The goal is not simply to identify whether a learning disorder is present, but to understand how cognitive, academic, emotional, behavioral, developmental, and environmental factors may be affecting school performance and daily learning demands.</h5>"
